      "value": 2,
      "quote": "You can't solve a problem you don't truly understand, and by name lists moves us from guessing how many people are experiencing homelessness once a year to knowing every individual by name in real time so we can connect them to the exact housing and support that they need.",
      "why": "Commits (she instigated the 30 Jul 2026 HIFIS / by-name motion). Comparable, not Same: real-time by-name coordinated access, not a published algorithmic waitlist with rules. Not a Public Order Team (row 6). Not a sourced miss, so no Close cap.",
